# ContractNLI-derived NDA text (data_corpus3/, track_b_handoff/) is written
# byte-verbatim from ContractNLI's document['text'] field via
# evaluation/build_corpus3.py, using newline="" specifically so that
# ContractNLI's gold character-offset spans (gold_spans.json) line up exactly
# with the on-disk text. Git's core.autocrlf would otherwise rewrite LF -> CRLF
# on checkout for any contributor on Windows, silently shifting every offset
# past the first line break and breaking span grading with no error. -text
# disables all of Git's newline normalization for these files: stored and
# checked out exactly as committed, on every platform.
data_corpus3/**/*.txt -text
track_b_handoff/**/*.txt -text
